Z||000005||Big O||05-20-2000||10:41 PM||||George,<P>I think they are killer wheels.  Be careful with the selection of tires for the rear though. I had 245-45ZR16 BFG Comp TA's on the back of mine and they rubbed on the strut towers and ate on e of the tires up.  When you get ready to put on some tires come and see me, I'll fit you up with some nice ones that fit properly.||||reg||1
Z||000006||fieroshop||05-21-2000||01:38 AM||||Big O I checked out the size with a computer and the difference between the stock 215-60hr15 is height +.17", width +.79" and total circumference +.53" These wheels also have an offset of 40mm which is ideal for the Fieros and helps reduce scrub radius. I will call you on Monday.||||reg||1
